    "title": "Port Richmond Shoplifter Pulls Knife on Teen Clerk, NYPD Hunts Suspect - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juliana Vance ,\n10 hours ago A 16-year-old employee at a Port Richmond grocery store came face to face with a knife on Sunday, July 19, after trying to stop a man from walking out of the shop without paying for his items. The confrontation, which happened around 7:40 p.m. inside a commercial storefront at 170 Port Richmond Avenue, ended with the suspect fleeing on foot, heading south on Port Richmond Avenue. NYPD Crime Stoppers is now asking the public for help identifying the man responsible. Read full article\n2",
